        "status": "identified",
        "body": "Customers running Docker executor jobs with the IP ranges feature enabled are experiencing a higher rate of infrastructure failures. A fix is being rolled out. Customers who see an infrastructure failure on one of these jobs can rerun the failed job.  We will provide another update as we have more information to share.",
